LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\">◈ 강좌기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 11. 4.(월) ~ 11. 16.(토) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\">◈ 강좌일시 : 평일 18시 ~ 22시</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\">◈ 시헙일시 : 2013. 11. 16(토) 10:00 ~ 11:30 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">(시험 반드시 응시해야함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\">◈ 강좌내용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 강의계획서 참고<a href=\"http://linc.kumoh.ac.kr/facility/linc/page/subLocation.do?menu_no=30100401\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(LINC 홈페이지로가기)</span></a> ← 클릭</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\">◈ 선발기준 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\">선착순 30명 모집</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZ